{"type":"standard","title":"Jamie Ager","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Jamie Ager</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q141630587","titles":{"canonical":"Jamie_Ager","normalized":"Jamie Ager","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Jamie Ager</span></span>"},"pageid":84399379,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383711370","tid":"bced6b82-d82d-11f1-a798-7e6a3953fcce","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:57:18Z","description":"American farmer and political candidate","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamie_Ager","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamie_Ager?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamie_Ager?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Jamie_Ager"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamie_Ager","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Jamie_Ager","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamie_Ager?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Jamie_Ager"}},"extract":"Jamie Ager is an American farmer, businessman, and politician who is the member-elect of the United States House of Representatives from North Carolina's 11th congressional district. A member of the Democratic Party, Ager is the co-founder and chief executive of Hickory Nut Gap, a regenerative farm and locally sourced meat distributor based on his family's farm in Fairview, North Carolina. Ager is the Democratic nominee for North Carolina's 11th congressional district in the 2026 election.","extract_html":"<p><b>Jamie Ager</b> is an American farmer, businessman, and politician who is the member-elect of the United States House of Representatives from North Carolina's 11th congressional district. A member of the Democratic Party, Ager is the co-founder and chief executive of Hickory Nut Gap, a regenerative farm and locally sourced meat distributor based on his family's farm in Fairview, North Carolina. Ager is the Democratic nominee for North Carolina's 11th congressional district in the 2026 election.</p>"}